=3D"https://hacktricks.wiki/en/index.html#hacktricks">HackTricks</a></h1>
<figure><img src=3D"https://hacktricks.wiki/en/images/hacktricks.gif" alt=
=3D""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p><em>Hacktricks logos &amp; motion design by</em> <a href=3D"https://www.=
instagram.com/ppieranacho/"><em>@ppieranacho</em></a><em>.</em></p>
<h3 id=3D"run-hacktricks-locally"><a class=3D"header" href=3D"https://hackt=
ricks.wiki/en/index.html#run-hacktricks-locally">Run HackTricks Locally</a>=
</h3>
<pre><div class=3D"buttons"><button class=3D"clip-button" title=3D"Copy to =
clipboard" aria-label=3D"Copy to clipboard"><i class=3D"tooltiptext"></i></=
button></div><code class=3D"language-bash hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment=
"># Download latest version of hacktricks</span>
git <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/HackTrick=
s-wiki/hacktricks

<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Select the language you want to use</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">export</span> HT_LANG=3D<span class=3D"hljs-s=
tring">"master"</span> <span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Leave master for Engl=
ish</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "af" for Afrikaans</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "de" for German</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "el" for Greek</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "es" for Spanish</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "fr" for French</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "hi" for HindiP</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "it" for Italian</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "ja" for Japanese</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "ko" for Korean</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "pl" for Polish</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "pt" for Portuguese</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "sr" for Serbian</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "sw" for Swahili</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "tr" for Turkish</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "uk" for Ukrainian</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># "zh" for Chinese</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Run the docker container indicating the path=
 to the hacktricks folder</span>
docker run -d --rm --platform linux/amd64 -p 3337:3000 --name hacktricks -v=
 $(<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">pwd</span>)/hacktricks:/app ghcr.io/hacktr=
icks-wiki/hacktricks-cloud/translator-image bash -c <span class=3D"hljs-str=
ing">"mkdir -p ~/.ssh &amp;&amp; ssh-keyscan -H github.com &gt;&gt; ~/.ssh/=
known_hosts &amp;&amp; cd /app &amp;&amp; git config --global --add safe.di=
rectory /app &amp;&amp; git checkout <span class=3D"hljs-variable">$HT_LANG=
</span> &amp;&amp; git pull &amp;&amp; MDBOOK_PREPROCESSOR__HACKTRICKS__ENV=
=3Ddev mdbook serve --hostname 0.0.0.0"</span>
</code></pre>
<p>Your local copy of HackTricks will be <strong>available at <a href=3D"ht=
tp://localhost:3337/">http://localhost:3337</a></strong> after &lt;5 minute=
s (it needs to build the book, be patient).</p>
<p>Alternatively, if you have Docker Compose you can just run the following=
 from the repo root:</p>
<pre><div class=3D"buttons"><button class=3D"clip-button" title=3D"Copy to =
clipboard" aria-label=3D"Copy to clipboard"><i class=3D"tooltiptext"></i></=
button></div><code class=3D"language-bash hljs">docker compose up
</code></pre>
<p>This uses the bundled <code class=3D"hljs">docker-compose.yml</code> to =
serve the branch currently checked out on the host at <a href=3D"http://loc=
alhost:3337/">http://localhost:3337</a> with live reload. To change languag=
es when using Compose, check out the desired language branch before startin=
g the service.</p>
