-cluster navigation, RBAC, Helm, logs, YAML, and terminal views. The vendor=
 says it connects through kubeconfig without installing agents and supports=
 macOS, Windows, Linux, and air-gapped clusters.<sup><a href=3D"https://hac=
ktricks.wiki/en/index.html#references">[11]</a></sup></p>
